<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <meta name="mcai-preview-error" code="503" content="开发环境 fa78b44aae55432f 与服务端的连接已断开，可能已经休眠，请在 MonkeyCode-AI 平台打开该任务界面，以唤醒开发环境。" data-request-id="RL-75f89e8b2bb8b12098fb4b8d8d23993b"/>
    <title>503 开发环境连接失败</title>
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #f5f6fa;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #1a1a2e;
        }

        .card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 720px;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e74c3c 0%, #c0392b 100%);
            padding: 32px 36px 28px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #fff;
            animation: pulse 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% {
                opacity: 1;
            }
            50% {
                opacity: 0.35;
            }
        }

        .status-code {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
        }

        .status-text {
            margin-top: 6px;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .card-body {
            padding: 28px 36px 32px;
        }

        .reason {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .meta-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .meta-table tr + tr td {
            border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
        }

        .meta-table td {
            padding: 9px 0;
            vertical-align: top;
            line-height: 20px;
        }

        .meta-table td:first-child {
            width: 110px;
            color: #999;
            font-weight: 500;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .meta-table td:last-child, code {
            color: #333;
            word-break: break-all;
            font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Menlo, monospace;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
        }

        .card-footer {
            padding: 18px 36px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #bbb;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            line-height: 20px;
        }

        .align-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .shield-icon svg {
            opacity: 0.4;
        }

        .mcai-link {
            color: brown;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .mcai-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card" id="mcai-preview-error-card">
